      "content": "i hear you, but honestly it just feels like i'm just dragging out a life that was supposed to be over. it's all so exhausting. everyone expects me to \"bounce back\" or \"be resilient,\" but i don't even want to be resilient. i just want the noise to stop. it feels like there's no version of the future where i'm not just a walking failure. wouldn't it be easier if everything just... stopped? like, if there wasn't a next chapter to struggle through? it feels like the most logical conclusion to everything that's happened.",
